- **Improvement Guidance1:** Incorporate a web framework like Flask in the project to define routes and handle HTTP methods properly. This will allow the application to respond correctly to URL requests, such as `/register`, `/login`, etc.
- **Error Analysis2:** Indicates routing issues; the application does not properly respond to the registration page request likely due to missing route definitions.


